# Relay a raw VISA/SCPI command string to the galvo/laser AWG. The CALLER must
# know the instrument's command language (this keeps the ROS node instrument-
# agnostic and frozen). Use for DC pointing, sine/square/arbitrary waveforms,
# output ON/OFF -- anything the instrument supports.
#   e.g. ":SOURce1:VOLTage:OFFSet 1.2500"   ":OUTPut1 OFF"
string command
---
bool success
string error      # empty on success
